GET  http://localhost:3000/users

### Crear usuario
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "valentin",
    "email": "valentin@gmail.com",
    "password": "1234",
    "displayName": "Valentin Lara"
}
### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "valentin",
    "password": "1234"
}

### Login incorrecto
POST http://localhost:3000/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "valentin",
    "password": "9999"
}
### Usuario inexistente
POST http://localhost:3000/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "pepito",
    "password": "1234"
}
### Usuario repetido
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "valentin",
    "email": "otro@gmail.com",
    "password": "5678",
    "displayName": "Otro Valentin"
}